/*  Function Name : ih264d_export_sei_mdcv_params                            */
/*                                                                           */
/*  Description   : This function populates SEI mdcv message in              */
/*                     output structure                                      */
/*  Inputs        : ps_sei_mdcv_op pointer to sei mdcv o\p struct            */
/*                : ps_sei pointer to decoded sei params                     */
/*  Outputs       :                                                          */
